Part 2: n equally spaced inputs in [-1,1], iid noise signs; L = 2, N = 6.
  'tracked' = mean z on (-)-noise points minus mean z on (+)-noise points (0 means no noise tracking;
  a full tracker of the windows would show about -0.55).  Also test MSE averaged over the training inputs
  with fresh labels, and the training-input average of (z - 0.6)^2.
